Snapshots are written here by `node registry/cli.mjs list` as <ISO-date>.json.
They exist for drift detection only (diff today vs yesterday: an address changed,
an asset was added, an asset was removed). They are never read as a source of
truth — production paths resolve from the live registry at runtime. See
registry/SOURCE.md. A committed snapshot promoted to truth is a hardcoded
address with extra steps.
